  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: "2026-10-28",
    modifiedTime: "2026-10-28",
    author: "Shaheer Ali Khan",
    section: "Fitness Equipment",
    tags: [
      "black friday treadmill deals under 1000",
      "treadmill under 1000 black friday",
      "horizon 7.0 at black friday",
      "nordictrack t series 10 deal",
      "sole f63 black friday",
      "black friday treadmill 2026",
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
  stickyCta={{ text: "Top Watch: Horizon 7.0 AT", link: PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl }}
>
  <article class="ed-article" data-template="editorial">
    <div class="ed-col">
      <nav class="ed-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/price/">By Price</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Black Friday 2026</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">Black Friday Treadmill Deals Under $1,000</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        The $700 to $1,500 band is where Black Friday treadmill reductions are most often real, and where last year’s model numbers get cleared. Here are six machines on Amazon worth watching, what they sold for in October 2026, and the price at which we think each becomes a good buy.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
          By <a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a><br />
          Updated October 28, 2026 · Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS
        </div>
        <a href="#top-picks" class="btn-ghost">View products</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ed-disclosure">
        We research every product on this page independently. If you buy through our links, we may earn a
        commission at no cost to you. <a href="/editorial-standards/">Learn more about how we review.</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="ed-hero">
        <div class="ed-hero-collage">
          <a href="#nordictrack-t-series-10"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31zk9ulTbQL._SL500_.jpg" alt="NordicTrack T Series 10" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#proform-carbon-tlx"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31kq3r4+jKL._SL500_.jpg" alt="ProForm Carbon TLX" width="500" height="498" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#horizon-t101-connect"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31pAWKay09L._SL500_.jpg" alt="Horizon T101 Connect" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>NordicTrack T Series 10 · ProForm Carbon TLX · Horizon T101 Connect</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          Under $1,000 is the price most people have in mind when they decide to buy a proper
          treadmill, and Black Friday is when machines that normally sell for $1,100 to $1,600 dip
          into it. This page is a watch list for that dip: six machines with a price we actually
          saw, a target price, and the two checks — deck length and top speed — that decide whether
          a sub-$1,000 machine is a running treadmill or a walking one.
        </p>

        <section id="top-picks" class="ed-toppicks not-prose">
          <h2>Our top picks:</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Top Watch:</span> <a href="#horizon-7-0-at">Horizon 7.0 AT</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[0].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best Touchscreen:</span> <a href="#nordictrack-t-series-10">NordicTrack T Series 10</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[1].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best Without a Screen:</span> <a href="#sole-f63">Sole F63</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[2].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Conditional Watch:</span> <a href="#proform-carbon-tlx">ProForm Carbon TLX</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[3].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="tp-label"><span class="tp-award">Best for Walking:</span> <a href="#horizon-t101-connect">Horizon T101 Connect</a></span>
              <a href={PRODUCTS[4].amazonUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener" class="buy-pill">Amazon &rarr;</a>
